	"name": "Chapter card \u2014 cinematic demo",
	"description": "Hero demo for the chapter-card Surface. Slow shader-side camera push with two-layer parallax (background drifts at the camera rate; atmospheric noise drifts at 1.7\u00d7 for closer-layer parallax) over a deep cool slate substrate; single warm key-light implied from upper-right (off-centre, not radial halo). Centred kicker over huge serif title. 8 s duration lets the camera move breathe; designed to read as a documentary chapter break.",
